WEBVTT

00:37:28.900 --> 00:37:31.876
With their suits halfway on
and radios strapped to their chest,

00:37:31.900 --> 00:37:34.036
they sit around the heart of the station,

00:37:34.060 --> 00:37:36.916
an old wooden kitchen table.

00:37:36.940 --> 00:37:39.766
DR: It's got a lot of miles on it,
like a lot of us do.

00:37:39.790 --> 00:37:42.216
AG: That table is a natural
place for support,

00:37:42.240 --> 00:37:45.976
to share good experiences
but also bad memories.

00:37:46.000 --> 00:37:48.766
Of course, the tone is set at the top.

00:37:48.790 --> 00:37:50.552
One of the key moments at South Metro

00:37:50.576 --> 00:37:54.636
was at a meeting with over 800
firefighters and paramedics.

00:37:54.660 --> 00:37:57.366
Several of them stood up
to share their struggles.

00:37:57.390 --> 00:38:00.136
Chris says it started
when the fire chief publicly stated